Vectr proxy (experimental — Proactive context) starting.
  Listening : http://127.0.0.1:8904
  Upstream  : https://api.anthropic.com
  Injection : off (transparent pass-through)
  Resp cache: off
  Wire it up:
    export ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8904
  Bypass at any time by unsetting it:
    unset ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL
  Caveats on a non-first-party base URL (documented upstream):
    - MCP tool search is disabled unless ENABLE_TOOL_SEARCH=true and the proxy forwards tool_reference blocks.
    - Remote Control is disabled on a non-api.anthropic.com base URL.
  The upstream API key is forwarded untouched and never stored or logged.
